/* AGREGAT — Dark theme overlay (Sprint 2.8 skeleton).
 *
 * The base palette lives in ``gui/theme.py`` (THEMES["dark"]); this
 * file is the place future GUI work parks "structural" QSS — fonts,
 * radii, spacing — that the Python-built stylesheet doesn't already
 * cover. Loaded at runtime by ``ThemeService.qss("dark")``.
 */

QToolTip {
    border: 1px solid #252530;
    background: #1A1A1F;
    color: #E8E8EE;
    padding: 4px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
}
